#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3434a1378966e63bb168f6ea5e737fec34ee7390405b109f91b270f38523ca98
#. default-sha256: b8c82dd248d91c5b978f44b90b5218d4472dab7312528032cc1ea057742705ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫En prenant le collier, Jacopo a l’air d’être sur le point de "
"pleurer."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2ff19f14129150803558a06c473aab378b316c10edfe5db74c454c4a73ea805
#. default-sha256: 74f2171eedbce91dfbd0ba2fa3a759c521a8b7f3d76ab8e3a475d37a5fbcecb7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais que ce soit par pudeur pour ne pas perdre la face ou simplement parce qu’il n’en est "
"plus capable, il ne verse pas une seule larme."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bafa47108d85397a77afc59771a85d147cbc31393aaf6737bb6d58fa8d743d4
#. default-sha256: 4111ea37128e8af87c8c714b710b6bc01f63da7e97b72bff50863cc48ea17318
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les deux autres se contentent de le regarder en silence."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6bc8fbabb03634667a4a0332c7d5014a79ddf349c054f54c77a1c5982ccd95e
#. default-sha256: 7c3e12add559d4936642490f17ddb07f2d171a749c900d99ab572995cbc9da3b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aucun d’entre eux n’a vu la vision du passé, et pourtant ils ne posent aucune question."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaff040ca1299e52ea9b8e7e74d3ff4922cbe35b2d4e542e23988db11c49feb8
#. default-sha256: 4ee3559fdaa98bdcf9fdab4ef7efcf83a85fdae157572518274b5ce79e6fa117
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Notre échange était probablement suffisant pour leur donner une petite idée de ce qui s’est "
"passé, même s’ils n’en connaissent pas les détails."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fe251220576135c84f7400ca6ab591b920206148d62e0e2ac6f5e0b3858894c
#. default-sha256: 69365857d25ff057ab6f0735a7dcbc6a43ba5f132aecf4905c09740b96180f51
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Serrant le collier d’une main, Jacopo prend la tête de la procession qui mène à la tour "
"d’observation."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff2f754aa375ac4f42411d989a3a31c3a7ee0efbb2e33d4a4403d99d5f2f420f
