msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There couldn’t be. It’s only Morgana."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Impossible. Il n’y a que Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90CC1DC7_EBA9_415C_975A_E1CCEC9571C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ecafb212a67479189bed1a988c16fc766c6707453745dd09c2d06a4570bd89a
